[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-emcr-laptop-scholarship-for-female-nurses-in-nigeria-2026-254":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},254,"emcr-laptop-scholarship-for-female-nurses-in-nigeria-2026-254","Emcr Laptop Scholarship For Female Nurses In Nigeria 2026","\u003Cp>Equitable Medicaid and Clinical Research invites female nursing students in Nigeria to apply for the 2026 Laptop Scholarship Program. This scholarship is designed to support nursing students who need laptops for learning, assignments, online classes, research, and academic growth.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>EMCR Laptop Scholarship Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Host: Equitable Medicaid and Clinical Research (EMCR)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Free Laptop\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: All Countries\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: June 15, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Laptop Scholarship 2026 Details\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>This program supports female nurses in Nigeria with laptops to improve digital learning, medical research, online training, and career development. Many nurses struggle to access modern technology needed for healthcare education and professional growth.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Through this scholarship, selected participants will receive laptops to help them study, work, and build their future in the healthcare sector.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>This initiative is designed to provide laptops to hundreds of students in public nursing schools to support their clinical research, assignments, and digital healthcare skills\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>EMCR Laptop Scholarship 2026 For Female Nurses Benefits\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Scholarship offers the refurbished laptops to over 100 female nursing students to aid the medical research, assignment and professional developmnt.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>EMCR Laptop Scholarship Requirements\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the EMCR Laptop Scholarship, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be a female Nursing students\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Currently enrolled in a recognized nursing school\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>EMCR Laptop Scholarship 2026 Required Documents\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>While applying for the Laptop Scholarship for Female Nurses 2026, you will be required to submit the following documents;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>A professional headshot\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>In 50 words, explain why you need the laptop\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>How To Apply for Laptop Scholarship for Female Nurses in Nigeria\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the EMCR Laptop Scholarship for Female Nurses 2026, follow the instructions we have outlined below; \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Read the information we have provided on this webpage and ensure your eligibility\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Prepare your professional headshot\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Fill the application form\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Prepare your statement of purpose (In 50 words)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Deadline: June 15th, 2026\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>APPLY HERE: \u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fdocs.google.com\u002Fforms\u002Fd\u002Fe\u002F1FAIpQLSdbr2I7b0bwNPS8QXLwsNBFCRxQRRgbFyevxQz8lVPKUtSZRg\u002Fviewform\">\u003Cstrong>https:\u002F\u002Fdocs.google.com\u002Fforms\u002Fd\u002Fe\u002F1FAIpQLSdbr2I7b0bwNPS8QXLwsNBFCRxQRRgbFyevxQz8lVPKUtSZRg\u002Fviewform\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","LINKSKOOL",16,"published",0,"2026-05-21 09:06:47",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Femcr-laptop-scholarship-for-female-nurses-in-nigeria-2026\u002F6a0ebd174c10e2.23860139_screenshot 2026-05-21 090536.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Femcr-laptop-scholarship-for-female-nurses-in-nigeria-2026\u002F6a0ebd174c10e2.23860139_screenshot%202026-05-21%20090536.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",[28,37,47,57,66,75,84,93,101],{"id":29,"slug":30,"title":31,"images":32,"datePosted":36,"authorName":9},305,"dartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship Usa 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[33],{"fileName":34,"oldFileName":34,"type":18,"file":19,"url":35},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot 2026-06-24 204255.png","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-